Subject: [PATCH 256/263] Use rank-two single-head prefill math

---
 .../nvidia_typed_tensor_ir_builder.cpp        | 95 ++++++++++++-------
 tests/ut/cpp/structured_compile_test.cpp      | 21 ++++
 2 files changed, 84 insertions(+), 32 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/compiler/nvidia_typed_tensor_ir_builder.cpp b/src/compiler/nvidia_typed_tensor_ir_builder.cpp
